al-intelligence/","totalParameters":2000000000000,"activeParameters":288000000000,"numExperts":16,"inputModalities":["text","image"],"outputModalities":["text"],"task":"Text Generation","architecture":"llama4","architectureFamily":"Llama 4","isMoe":true,"parameterConfidence":"official","parameterSource":"Meta describes Llama 4 Behemoth as a multimodal MoE teacher model with 288B active parameters, 16 experts, and nearly 2T total parameters; the model was still training and had not been released as downloadable weights in the cited announcement.","parameterSourceUrl":"https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-4-multimodal-intelligence/","openness":"research-preview","nameNote":"Official Meta preview/teacher model. Meta reported nearly 2T total parameters, 288B active parameters, and 16 experts, but explicitly stated that Behemoth was still training and was not yet released as downloadable weights; no official Hugging Face repository was found."}');
